# Mongoose

```typescript
export type CategoryDocument = HydratedDocument<Category>;

@Schema({ timestamps: true })
export class Category {
  @Prop({ required: true, type: String, trim: true })
  name: string;
}

export const CategorySchema = SchemaFactory.createForClass(Category);
applyDocumentJsonTransform(CategorySchema);
```

## Rules

- Register with `MongooseModule.forFeature`
- Always apply `applyDocumentJsonTransform` (`id` instead of `_id`, drop `__v`)
- Secrets: `select: false`
- Unique fields: `unique: true` + handle duplicates in service/filter
- Optional empties: prefer `default: null`
- Mongoose only — no TypeORM/Prisma
